#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorials/index.rst:12
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/intro/sphinx`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/intro/sphinx`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorials/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"Sphinx is the most popular documentation tool on our platform. It supports "
"both reStructuredText and Markdown formats, and can generate rich API "
"documentation from your source code. We recommend Sphinx for documentation "
"that includes API reference documentation."
msgstr ""
"Sphinx 是我们平台上最流行的文档工具。它同时支持 reStructuredText 和 Markdown 格式，并能从源代码生成丰富的 API "
"文档。对于包含 API 参考文档的文档项目，我们推荐使用 Sphinx。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorials/index.rst:17
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/intro/mkdocs`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/intro/mkdocs`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorials/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"Another great and popular tool is MkDocs. This is especially popular because"
" of its default of using Markdown. This tool is well-supported on our "
"platform and that's why we have a tutorial."
msgstr "另一个优秀且流行的工具是 MkDocs。它因默认使用 Markdown 而特别受欢迎。该工具在我们的平台上得到了很好的支持，因此我们提供了相应教程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorials/index.rst:22
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/intro/add-project`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/intro/add-project`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorials/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"If you already wrote your documentation, this guide will help you get "
"started at the most natural point: importing an existing documentation "
"project."
msgstr "如果你已经编写好了文档，本指南将帮助你在最自然的起点开始：导入现有的文档项目。"

